Object.assign(V30_USAGE_EXAMPLES,{"hypothesis":["test a hypothesis","检验假设，而不是单纯确认自己希望看到的答案","The study tested the hypothesis using an independent dataset.","这项研究使用独立数据集检验了该假设。"],"assumption":["make an assumption","作出假设；要说明它是否能够得到证据支持","The estimate depends on an assumption about future demand.","这一估算取决于对未来需求的一项假设。"],"prediction":["make a prediction","作出预测；与已观察事实不同","The model made a prediction before the results were measured.","模型在结果测得之前作出了预测。"],"projection":["population projection","根据特定假设推算未来的情景","The population projection assumes a constant birth rate.","人口推算假定出生率保持不变。"],"estimation":["parameter estimation","根据数据估计模型参数","Parameter estimation should include a measure of uncertainty.","参数估计应包含不确定度的量化。"],"estimate":["estimate the cost","估算费用；不表示精确测定","We estimated the cost using the available invoices.","我们根据现有发票估算了成本。"],"approximation":["a good approximation","适用范围内的近似，而不是完全等价","The linear model is a good approximation at small angles.","在小角度情况下，线性模型是一个较好的近似。"],"perceive":["perceive a difference","感知或察觉差异；不等同于客观测量","Participants perceived a difference in sound quality.","参与者察觉到音质上的差异。"],"notice":["notice a change","注意到变化；强调察觉这一动作","I noticed a small change in the display after the update.","更新之后，我注意到显示效果有一点变化。"],"discover":["discover evidence","发现先前未知的证据或事实","Researchers discovered evidence of an earlier settlement.","研究人员发现了更早时期聚落存在的证据。"],"identify":["identify the cause","确定原因；比单纯注意到问题更进一步","The team identified the cause of the timing drift.","团队确定了时序漂移的原因。"],"calibration":["calibration procedure","校准流程；应区分校准与日常测量","The calibration procedure was repeated after the temperature changed.","温度变化后重新执行了校准流程。"],"measurement":["measurement uncertainty","测量不确定度；不是误差的同义词","The report includes the measurement uncertainty.","报告包含测量不确定度。"],"measure":["measure the response","测量响应；强调采集数据","We measured the response at several temperatures.","我们在几个不同温度下测量了响应。"],"interpretation":["alternative interpretation","另一种解释；数据本身未必唯一决定解释","The data admit more than one interpretation.","这些数据允许不止一种解释。"],"analyze":["analyze the results","分析结果；美式拼写 analyze，英式常为 analyse","We analyzed the results before drawing conclusions.","我们在得出结论前分析了结果。"],"synthesize":["synthesize findings","综合多项发现形成整体认识","The review synthesizes findings from several independent studies.","这篇综述综合了几项独立研究的结果。"],"aggregate":["aggregate data","汇总数据，可能掩盖组内差异","The chart aggregates data across different age groups.","图表汇总了不同年龄组的数据。"],"variation":["natural variation","自然变异或波动；与单一测量偏差不同","The measurements show natural variation between samples.","不同样本之间的测量结果显示出自然波动。"],"variance":["sample variance","样本方差；量化离散程度的统计量","The sample variance increased after the outlier was included.","纳入离群值后，样本方差增大了。"],"deviation":["standard deviation","标准差；不等于绝对误差","The standard deviation describes the spread of the observations.","标准差描述了观测数据的离散程度。"],"uncertainty":["quantify uncertainty","量化不确定度，而不是假装数据绝对精确","We quantified the uncertainty before comparing the measurements.","在比较测量结果之前，我们量化了不确定度。"],"systematic":["systematic review","遵循明确方法的系统性综述；不是“系统故障”的同义词","The authors conducted a systematic review of the available evidence.","作者对现有证据进行了系统性综述。"],"significance":["statistical significance","统计显著性；并不自动说明实际影响大","Statistical significance does not necessarily imply practical importance.","统计显著并不必然意味着实际意义重大。"],"substantial":["substantial improvement","幅度明显的改善；具体程度需结合语境","The revised design brought a substantial improvement in readability.","修改后的设计显著提升了可读性。"],"modest":["modest improvement","幅度有限、但可能仍有意义的改善","The change produced a modest improvement in accuracy.","这项改动使准确度略有提高。"],"intrinsic":["intrinsic property","事物自身固有的性质","The material has an intrinsic resistance to corrosion.","这种材料本身具有抗腐蚀性。"],"inherent":["inherent risk","与某项活动或性质无法轻易分离的风险","Every measurement has some inherent uncertainty.","每项测量都存在一定的固有不确定性。"],"contemporary":["contemporary literature","当代文学；也可表示与某人同一时代","The course focuses on contemporary literature.","这门课程重点研究当代文学。"],"historic":["historic achievement","具有历史重要性的成就，而非所有旧事物","The agreement was seen as a historic achievement.","该协议被视为一项具有历史意义的成就。"],"historical":["historical evidence","与过去有关的证据；不一定具有重大历史意义","The claim is supported by historical evidence.","这一说法有历史证据支持。"],"preceding":["the preceding paragraph","前一段；与 following 或 subsequent 相对","The definition is given in the preceding paragraph.","定义已在前一段给出。"],"misleading":["misleading impression","容易让人产生错误印象","The truncated axis gives a misleading impression of growth.","截断的坐标轴会让增长幅度显得不真实。"],"fallacy":["logical fallacy","逻辑谬误，而不仅是事实错误","The argument relies on a logical fallacy.","这一论证依赖于一个逻辑谬误。"],"noteworthy":["noteworthy exception","值得关注的例外；并非一定是最常见情况","There is one noteworthy exception to the rule.","这条规则有一个值得注意的例外。"],"probability":["probability distribution","概率分布；并非一个单独的预测值","The model outputs a probability distribution rather than a single value.","模型输出的是概率分布，而非单一数值。"]});
for(const guide of [{"words":["contemporary","contemporaneous"],"rule":"contemporary 可指“当代的”，也可指与另一人或事同一时代；contemporaneous 更强调两件事发生在同一时期，常见于历史、医学和法律语境。","examples":[["The exhibition shows contemporary art.","展览展出当代艺术。"],["The two records were contemporaneous.","这两份记录形成于同一时期。"]]},{"words":["estimate","predict"],"rule":"estimate 是根据已有信息估算数量、数值或成本，估计的对象可以是现在或过去；predict 是对尚未发生或未知结果作出预测。两者都可能使用模型，但目的不同。","examples":[["We estimate the current cost at €500.","我们估计目前的成本为500欧元。"],["The model predicts higher costs next year.","模型预测明年的成本会上升。"]]},{"words":["intrinsic","inherent"],"rule":"intrinsic 强调属于事物自身内在性质；inherent 强调与某种事物、活动或情境不可分离的特征。两者多有重叠，但 intrinsic value 和 inherent risk 的搭配更自然。","examples":[["The book has intrinsic value as a historical source.","这本书作为史料具有内在价值。"],["There are inherent risks in the procedure.","这项操作存在固有风险。"]]},{"words":["observation","inference"],"rule":"observation 指观察得到的现象或数据；inference 指基于证据推导出的结论。把推断当作直接观测会混淆论证层次。","examples":[["The observation was recorded at noon.","观测结果记录于中午。"],["The inference depends on several assumptions.","这项推断依赖数项假设。"]]},{"words":["significance","importance"],"rule":"significance 可指一般意义上的重要性，也可在统计学中指“显著性”；importance 指重要程度。statistical significance 不应直接翻译为“很重要”。","examples":[["The finding has practical importance.","这项发现具有实际重要性。"],["The result reached statistical significance.","这一结果达到了统计显著性。"]]},{"words":["measurement","estimate"],"rule":"measurement 是通过观测与仪器取得的测量结果；estimate 可以根据模型、间接证据或已有测量进行估计。两者都可能带有不确定度。","examples":[["The measurement was repeated three times.","这项测量重复了三次。"],["The estimate combines several measurements.","这一估计综合了多项测量结果。"]]}])for(const word of guide.words)(LEX40_CONTRASTS[word]??=[]).push(guide);
